comments.body:
@dicko72 The watch remains unstable when losing connection for the first time. The only solution I found is to turn off and on the BT. Then it reconnects and as soon as it remains stable is fine. Once it does not connect in the 5 minutes range who knows what can happen....

I still use the 14 feb version and my daughter learned how to turn on/off the watch so... it works for us. I heard that Irist https://www.amazon.es/Intex-IRist-Smartwatch-Android-Color/dp/B019RNFSWU  is working much better but I did not try it. Just saying.

Un saludo
